# The plain's perspective floor (SPEC 8, Paul 2026-11-12). Fly left flat
# out, high up: the camera settles at 3 px a frame. Floor line j (game line
# 180 + j) moves at (18 + j) / 72 of the camera. expect-scroll needs two rows,
# so each region pairs a floor line with one the art contract keeps
# transparent (rows 0 and 18: one colour, no vote): line 181 moves 19/24 px a
# frame, line 197 35/24 - next to the mountains' 3/4 and the hills' 3/2, two
# speeds no band has. The far strip (the mountains band's last rows, lines
# 170-179) moves as one block at the mountains' 3/4: it doesn't shear.
wait-serial "AGK t0"
press fire 2
wait 125
press up 80
hold left
wait 60
expect-scroll 0 180 319 181 136 19/24
expect-scroll 0 197 319 198 136 35/24
expect-scroll 0 170 319 178 136 3/4
screenshot plain
# the plain's ground: C (land pen 6, mission 1) on the floor's last line (row
# 18 is empty by contract) and between the hill crests below it
expect-color plain 4 198 0xDA6
expect-color plain 315 198 0xDA6
release
